poetry: disable tests broken by virtualenv 21.6.1

What it fixes:
  poetry 2.4.1 fails its test suite, so the package does not build:

    RuntimeError: embedded pip wheel not found
      at .../poetry/utils/env/base_env.py:168 in get_embedded_wheel

  virtualenv 21.6.1 changed get_embed_wheel(): previously any unrecognised
  Python version fell back to the newest bundled wheel set

    mapping = BUNDLE_SUPPORT.get(for_py_version, {}) or BUNDLE_SUPPORT[MAX]

  whereas now the fallback only applies to None or versions newer than MAX,
  and anything below MIN (now "3.9", since 21.6.1 also dropped "3.8")
  returns None.

  Poetry's MockEnv test double defaults to version_info = (3, 7, 0), so
  get_embedded_wheel("pip") asks for "3.7", gets None back, and raises.
  Three tests in tests/installation/test_executor.py fail as a result.

  This is a test-only breakage. Real environments report their actual
  Python version, which is bundled, so installed poetry is unaffected.

Why it's needed for devenv:
  The python-poetry and python-django examples both enable poetry, and
  their shell derivations fail to realize while poetry is unbuildable.

Upstream issue: https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/544083

diff --git a/pkgs/by-name/po/poetry/unwrapped.nix b/pkgs/by-name/po/poetry/unwrapped.nix
index c56b56b..4f43789 100644
--- a/pkgs/by-name/po/poetry/unwrapped.nix
+++ b/pkgs/by-name/po/poetry/unwrapped.nix
@@ -131,6 +131,14 @@ buildPythonPackage rec {
     "test_threading_single_thread_safe"
     "test_threading_property_caching"
     "test_threading_atomic_cached_property_different_instances"
+    # virtualenv 21.6.1 dropped the fallback to the newest bundled wheel for
+    # Python versions below MIN (3.9). Poetry's MockEnv defaults to (3, 7, 0),
+    # so get_embed_wheel returns None and Poetry raises
+    # "RuntimeError: embedded pip wheel not found".
+    # Only affects the test double; real environments report a bundled version.
+    # https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/544083
+    "test_execute_executes_a_batch_of_operations"
+    "test_execute_prints_warning_for_yanked_package"
   ]
   ++ lib.optionals stdenv.hostPlatform.isDarwin [
     # Sandbox violation:
